bridge spans over the Ramta River near Gimuosei."},{"id":"marker28","name":"The Proud Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious boiled sturgeon with purple juice is served here."},{"id":"marker29","name":"The Loud Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious mashed pottage with light kumis is served here."},{"id":"marker30","name":"The Dark Crow","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious boiled deer with white kvass is served here."},{"id":"marker31","name":"The Dark Horse","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious marinated chevon with bitter kvass is served here."},{"id":"marker32","name":"The Prime Goat","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious syrupped antlers with smelly cider is served here."},{"id":"marker33","name":"The Happy Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious mashed zucchini with red whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker34","name":"The Happy Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious deep-fried chicken with salty rom is served here."},{"id":"marker35","name":"The Peaceful Inn","legend":"A big and famous roadside inn. Delicious baked escallop with orange whisky is served here."},{"id":"marker36","name":"The Loud Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious syrupped broccoli with green juice is served here."},{"id":"marker37","name":"The Hungry Tavern","legend":"A big and famous roadside tavern. Delicious flame-broiled potato with sparkling beer is served here."},{"id":"marker38","name":"Metumijuwan Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker39","name":"Leluman Lighthouse","legend":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"id":"marker40","name":"Alinistan Waterfall","legend":"The rapids of an exceptionally beautiful waterfall."},{"id":"marker41","name":"Macleston Battlefield","legend":"A historical battle of the Bamlish Rebellion. \r\nDate: May 10, 114