kirk Giant","legend":"Journeying folk speak of a horrifying Giant who inhabits Causkirk hills and abducts young women."},{"id":"marker57","name":"Chand Ghoul","legend":"Rumors speak of a big Ghoul who inhabits Chand hills and terrorizes the region."},{"id":"marker58","name":"Ricengata Banshee","legend":"Locals speak of a proud Banshee who inhabits Ricengata hills and snatches people from homes."},{"id":"marker59","name":"Shush Hag","legend":"Tales speak of a horrifying Hag who inhabits Shush hills and doesn't mind human flesh."},{"id":"marker60","name":"Frasiaso Forest","legend":"A forest sacred to local Karokszentlo Religion."},{"id":"marker61","name":"Sergo Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Karokszentlo Religion."},{"id":"marker62","name":"Tungripoli Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Romian Deities."},{"id":"marker63","name":"Sicealido Dogs","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker64","name":"Kydon Hares","legend":"A gang of mounted bandits."},{"id":"marker65","name":"Arreta Hawks","legend":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"id":"marker66","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker67","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker68","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker69","name":"Leraintezu Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠪᠮᡏᢂᡔᢥᡮᠡᢏᠦᡔᡖᡠᠡᠰᠾᢋᡐᡖᡟᡁᢡᡏᢢᡮᢑᠡᡀᢞᡲᢏᢛᠱᡯᠮᢀᡯᡔᠻᢞ᠐ᠦᡖᡓᠻᠪᡰᠭᡭᠦᡆᡡᡁᢞᡞᠠᡞᢥᠩᡐᠳᢜᡖᡎᡓᢐᢁᢓᡕᠻᡰᠭᡑᠡᡗᢀᡒᠦᢠᠦᢏᠵᢟᡭᢐ᠒ᢑᠰᢜᡓᡳᢢᠱᡲᠪᡟ</div>"},{"id":"marker70","name":"Arrioakaolo Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\udc10 \udc35\udc0e𐠢\udc0d\udc0b 𐠏\udc25\udc26\udc24 \udc33\udc35\udc11\udc0b\udc16\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc2e\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠔\udc27\ud802𐠁𐠡\udc28\udc2d\ud802𐠋</div>"},{"id":"marker71","name":"Castrix Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰዘሰገወወረ ከፀደደበገፐወለከለጰአገ ነወለጸመፈኀከደገኀፀየፈ ሠበአ ፈገየተተፈነቀዘቀነሐበዐፐነጸሰረጠዐደደጰኀሐጠጰሀሐጸሠቀሰነ ጰ በ ዘተከፈፈጰለገአሠሐሠፐ</div>"},{"id":"marker72","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker73","name":"Ruined Fortress","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker74","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker75","name":"Orea Library","legend":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"id":"marker76","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker77","name":"Travelling Incomprehensible Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this incomprehensible circus is here for a limited time only."},{"id":"marker78","name":"Farva Fair","legend":"A fair is being held in Farva, with all manner of local and foreign goods and services on offer."},{"id":"marker79","name":"Minor Jetty","legend":"A small location along the Ramta River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"id":"marker80","name":"Jackals migration","legend":"A huge group of jackals are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker81","name":"Deer migration","legend":"A huge group of deer are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker82","name":"Larks migration","legend":"A huge group of larks are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"id":"marker83","name":"Diaphanous mirage","legend":"This diaphanous mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker84","name":"Entrancing mirage","legend":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"id":"marker85","name":"Hulag Cave","legend":"The Hulag Cave. Locals claim that it is completely flooded."},{"id":"marker86","name":"Azahzut Fracture","legend":"The Azahzut Fracture. Locals claim that it is endlessly deep and unexplored."},{"id":"marker87","name":"Betnesham Necropolis","legend":"A towering necropolis adorned with macabre sculptures and guarded by formidable undead sentinels. Its ancient halls house the remains of fallen heroes, entombed alongside their cherished relics."},{"id":"marker88","name":"Hatherscom Necropolis","legend":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"id":"marker89","name":"Thaxningley Crypt","legend":"A foreboding necropolis perched atop a jagged cliff, overlooking a desolate wasteland. Its towering walls harbor restless spirits, and the imposing gates bear the marks of countless battles and ancient curses."},{"id":"marker90","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/7337\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker91","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/85\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker92","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/5511\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker93","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2106\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker94","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4552\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker95","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3817\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker96","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3917\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"id":"marker97","name":"Random encounter","legend":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/142\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"}]
